@startuml
' MPSCRING-DOC-SDD, figure 5-1: one slot's sequence through one lap, for the position pos it serves (N = capacity, slot = pos & (N - 1))
title MPSCring: a slot's sequence (Vyukov's protocol)
hide empty description
[*] --> Free : init: sequence = slot index\n(the first lap's pos)
state "Free for pos\nsequence == pos" as Free
state "Claimed by one producer\nsequence == pos\nenqueue_pos > pos" as Claimed
state "Published for pos\nsequence == pos + 1" as Published
state "Read, free for pos + N\nsequence == pos + N" as Freed
Free --> Claimed : a producer sees pos == sequence\nand wins CAS enqueue_pos pos -> pos + 1
Claimed --> Published : the producer stores data,\nrelease store sequence = pos + 1
Published --> Freed : the consumer at dequeue_pos == pos:\nacquire sequence, read data,\nrelease store sequence = pos + N
Freed --> Free : the next lap: this slot serves pos + N
Published --> Published : a producer for pos + N sees sequence < pos + N:\nfull, push returns -1 (the slot is not read yet)
Claimed --> Claimed : the consumer at pos sees sequence < pos + 1:\nempty, pop returns -1\n(a stalled producer holds every later position)
@enduml
